  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>flurbiprofen</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>M01AE09</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, IV dosing <small>(PK_1C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Aarons L 1991</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>rheumatoid arthritis patients</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>flurbiprofen</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_flurbiprofen/Flurbiprofen_Aarons1991_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>plasma parameters, clearance</td><td>1.75</td><td>L hr-1</td><td><small>CL</small></td></tr><tr><td>plasma parameters, volume of distribution</td><td>11.9</td><td>L</td><td><small>V</small></td></tr><tr><td>plasma parameters, elimination half-life</td><td>4.8</td><td>hr</td><td><small>t1/2z</small></td></tr></table><h4>About flurbiprofen</h4><p>Flurbiprofen is a non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drug used to treat pain and inflammation in conditions such as osteoarthritis and rheumatoid arthritis, and is also applied topically for joint, muscular, throat, and eye problems. It is an approved medicine used in several forms, including tablets, topical preparations, throat lozenges, and eye drops, though it carries a boxed warning.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q419890\">Wikidata Q419890</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Flurbiprofen\">Flurbiprofen</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Aarons L (1991). The kinetics of flurbiprofen in synovial fluid. <i>Journal of pharmacokinetics and biopharmaceutics 19(3):265–269</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/BF03036250\">10.1007/BF03036250</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/1875281\">1875281</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Aarons_1991: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
